      "options": {
        "content": "## 📚 Panel Configuration Guide\n\n### Quick Reference:\n\n**Time Series** - `pluginId: \"timeseries\"`\n- Line graphs, area charts, bar charts over time\n- Use `custom.drawStyle`: \"line\" | \"bars\" | \"points\"\n- Best for: trends, patterns, time-based analysis\n\n**Table** - `pluginId: \"table\"`\n- Sortable, filterable columns\n- Use `seriesToRows` transformation for instant queries\n- Best for: >6 entities, structured data\n\n**Bar Chart** - `pluginId: \"barchart\"`\n- Horizontal/vertical comparison\n- Best for: 2-6 entities, current value comparison\n\n**Stat** - `pluginId: \"stat\"`\n- Single value + sparkline\n- Best for: KPIs, aggregated totals\n\n**Gauge** - `pluginId: \"gauge\"`\n- Circular percentage display\n- Best for: utilization, capacity metrics\n\n**Pie Chart** - `pluginId: \"piechart\"`\n- Proportional visualization\n- Best for: distributions, categorical breakdowns\n\n**Heatmap** - `pluginId: \"heatmap\"`\n- Density over time\n- Best for: latency distributions, histograms\n\n**Logs** - `pluginId: \"logs\"`\n- Formatted log viewer\n- Best for: application/system logs\n\n**Geomap** - `pluginId: \"geomap\"`\n- Geographic markers\n- Best for: regional data, location-based metrics\n\n**Text** - `pluginId: \"text\"`\n- Documentation panels (markdown/HTML)\n- Best for: dashboard context, instructions",
